{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはなーこ(*ﾟvﾟ*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曇りですね!湿気で髪の毛がふわふわしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おだなーこ はいつも元気です❁"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH830A4QF2VEQ9HP39HA7Z2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく見たらちょっとだけぶれてた(^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、「世界には愛しかない」どうでしたか?(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、世界には愛しかないの青春っぽい歌詞が好きです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2番の、悲しみなんてその時の空模様というところがすきです(´▽`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨の歌詞っていいですよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょうど今は梅雨の時期なので、雨が降っている時には世界には愛しかない をききます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非、みなさんも沢山聞いてくださいね。\nそして、世界には愛しかないの感想を握手会で教えてください!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ!\n今日から握手会の第三次応募が始まります。\nみなさん、お忘れなく〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぽちぽち。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH831F6TYGJFN68M48EBAFX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました!\n風邪ひかないでね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}